# Scratch space for files generated/used during a deployment (e.g. the
# temp eksctl ClusterConfig and deployment.env state file scripts/startall.sh
# writes per cluster+release into deployed-<cluster>-<release>/, and a good
# place to redirect startup.log/stopall.log too) -- never tracked.
deployed/
deployed-*/
tmp/

# startup-<domain>.log/stopall-<domain>.log written by scripts/startall.sh
# and scripts/stopall.sh (see their exec > >(tee ...) setup), plus any other
# ad-hoc log redirected here manually -- never tracked.
*.log

# License files (e.g. GDS/Bloom) fed into the license-config configmap by
# scripts/startall.sh's `kubectl create configmap license-config
# --from-file=licenses/` step -- never tracked, drop your .license file(s)
# in here locally. The licenses/ directory itself stays tracked.
licenses/*.license
